{"id":"e919bc05b2851392","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-extension.md","title":"Field Extension","display":"df-extension — Field Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-extension","aliases":["58-df-extension","Extension","Field Extension"],"display":"df-extension — Field Extension","depends_on":["[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-polynomial]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-extension</span><span>Extension</span><span>Field Extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extension — Field Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,P_K\\in V\">\\(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,P_K\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in L\">\\(\\alpha\\in L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subfield}_S,\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Subfield}_S,\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Algebraic}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{Algebraic}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}:V^2\\to L\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}:V^2\\to L\\)</span> (evaluation of a one-variable coefficient map in the ambient field, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}subfield}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subfield}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\land K\\subseteq L\\land0_L,1_L\\in K\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in K\\;\\Bigl(\n+_L(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in K\n\\land\\cdot_L(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in K\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(a\\neq0_L\\to\\exists c\\in K\\;\n\\cdot_L(\\langle a,c\\rangle)=1_L)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}subfield}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subfield}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\land K\\subseteq L\\land0_L,1_L\\in K\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in K\\;\\Bigl(\n+_L(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in K\n\\land\\cdot_L(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in K\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(a\\neq0_L\\to\\exists c\\in K\\;\n\\cdot_L(\\langle a,c\\rangle)=1_L)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subfield}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subfield}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}(f,\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sum_{m\\in\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:f(r)\\neq0_L\\}} f(m)\\cdot_L\\alpha^m\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}(f,\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sum_{m\\in\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:f(r)\\neq0_L\\}} f(m)\\cdot_L\\alpha^m\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Algebraic}_S(\\alpha,K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\land\\alpha\\in L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists P_K,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P_K,K,+_L\\!\\upharpoonright K^2,\\cdot_L\\!\\upharpoonright K^2,0_L,1_L,1)\\land f\\in P_K\\land f\\neq\\{\\langle m,0_L\\rangle:m\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\land\\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}(f,\\alpha)=0_L\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Algebraic}_S(\\alpha,K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\land\\alpha\\in L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists P_K,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P_K,K,+_L\\!\\upharpoonright K^2,\\cdot_L\\!\\upharpoonright K^2,0_L,1_L,1)\\land f\\in P_K\\land f\\neq\\{\\langle m,0_L\\rangle:m\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\land\\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}(f,\\alpha)=0_L\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The extension predicates carry the ambient field operations explicitly, so the subfield closure and polynomial evaluation refer to the same structure.  Extension degree requires a separately sourced basis/dimension predicate and is therefore not introduced here as an unsupported total operator.</li>\n<li>Algebraic: satisfies polynomial equation</li>\n<li>Transcendental: not algebraic</li>\n<li>Normal + separable = Galois</li>\n<li>Fundamental theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[E:K] = [E:F][F:K]\">\\([E:K] = [E:F][F:K]\\)</span></li>\n<li>Algebraicity now quantifies over the registered finite-support polynomial carrier and a locally defined evaluation map, instead of treating the set code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> as an unspecified callable polynomial.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lang, Algebra</li>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,P_K\\in V$ (see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-polynomial]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,P_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subfield}_S,\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Algebraic}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}:V^2\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}subfield}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subfield}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\land K\\subseteq L\\land0_L,1_L\\in K\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in K\\;\\Bigl(\n+_L(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in K\n\\land\\cdot_L(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in K\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\n(a\\neq0_L\\to\\exists c\\in K\\;\n\\cdot_L(\\langle a,c\\rangle)=1_L)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subfield}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}(f,\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sum_{m\\in\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:f(r)\\neq0_L\\}} f(m)\\cdot_L\\alpha^m","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}algebraic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Algebraic}_S(\\alpha,K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FieldExt}_S(K,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L)\n\\land\\alpha\\in L\\\\\n&\\land\\exists P_K,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P_K,K,+_L\\!\\upharpoonright K^2,\\cdot_L\\!\\upharpoonright K^2,0_L,1_L,1)\\land f\\in P_K\\land f\\neq\\{\\langle m,0_L\\rangle:m\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\land\\operatorname{ev}_{K\\subseteq L}(f,\\alpha)=0_L\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[E:K] = [E:F][F:K]","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":2725,"backlinks":[{"id":"0138480e8111b6c9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-510","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-extension.md|58-df-extension]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda","ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","592f9cfb66a507c2"]}